WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:04.400
Have you ever wondered what SCP-312,&nbsp;
the Atmospheric Jellyfish, wants?

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:07.820
Foundation staff used SCP-978, the Desire Camera,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:13.640
to snap a picture of SCP-312 while it was floating&nbsp;
in its containment chamber. This was the result:

00:00:13.640 --> 00:00:17.360
"Photograph appears to be an&nbsp;
unidentifiable location somewhat&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:22.340
similar to the surface of Mars with nine&nbsp;
more instances of SCP-312 in the photo.

00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:27.740
This may indicate that SCP-312&nbsp;
may not be a terrestrial species."

